<!--[if true]><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="width:600px;direction:ltr"><tr><![endif]-->
<div class="kl-row colstack" style="display:table;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;">
<!--[if true]><td style="vertical-align:top;width:600px;"><![endif]-->
<div class="kl-column" style="display:table-cell;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
<div class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix component-wrapper" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%;" width="100%">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="" style="vertical-align:top;padding-top:9px;padding-right:18px;padding-bottom:9px;padding-left:18px;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="" width="100%">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td align="left" class="kl-text" style="font-size:0px;padding:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;">
<div style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#393939;"><div> </div>
<p data-end="349" data-start="330">Hi <span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;">{!</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;">Lead.Name</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;">}</span>,</p>
<p data-end="349" data-start="330">We’re thrilled to introduce a bold new way to stock FRE: our <strong>100-count mega</strong> <strong>packs</strong> are now available! Designed for high-frequency users and cost-conscious customers, these mega packs deliver FRE’s premium nicotine experience—now with even greater convenience and value.</p>
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="font-size: 0px; font-family: Times; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; height: 96px;" width="100%">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 96px;">
<td align="left" class="kl-text" style="font-size: 0px; width: 100%; height: 96px;">
<div style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 150%; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); text-align: left;">
<div><strong><strong class="font-bold">What's Inside:</strong></strong></div>
<div>
<ul data-end="953" data-start="743">
<li data-end="818" data-start="743">
<p data-end="818" data-start="745" style="padding-bottom:0">100 nicotine white pouches per pack</p>
</li>
<li data-end="896" data-start="819">
<p data-end="896" data-start="821" style="padding-bottom:0">Made with <strong data-end="755" data-start="723">Non-Tobacco Derived Nicotine</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-end="896" data-start="819">
<p data-end="896" data-start="821" style="padding-bottom:0">Available in 3<strong data-end="787" data-start="771">mg and 15mg</strong> strengths</p>
</li>
</ul>
<div><strong>Flavors Your Customers Know and Love:</strong></div>
<div>
<ul>
<li data-end="1486" data-start="1415">
<p data-end="1486" data-start="1417" style="padding-bottom:0"><strong data-end="859" data-start="844">Wintergreen</strong> – A bold dose of nicotine with a fresh kick of classic wintergreen and a pinch of sweet undertones.</p>
</li>
<li data-end="1523" data-start="1487">
<p data-end="1523" data-start="1489" style="padding-bottom:0"><strong data-end="973" data-start="965">Mint</strong> – A bold and powerful nicotine experience with a crisp, cool mint finish.</p>
</li>
<li data-end="1523" data-start="1487"><strong data-end="1065" data-start="1053">Original</strong> – A clean, straightforward nicotine pouch with a fresh kick and no added flavors.</li>
<li data-end="1523" data-start="1487"><strong>Lush </strong>– C<span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: aglet-slab, sans-serif; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: start;">ombines the sweet, juicy taste of mango and tropical fruits with the crisp, refreshing finish of watermelon. </span></li>
<li><strong>Sweet </strong>– <span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: aglet-slab, sans-serif; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: start;">A strong blast of nicotine without any extra additives.</span></li>
</ul>
<div><strong>Why Stock the 100-Count Format?</strong></div>
<div>
<ul>
<li data-end="1486" data-start="1415">
<p data-end="1486" data-start="1417" style="padding-bottom:0"><strong data-end="1201" data-start="1187">High value</strong>: Better cost per pouch drives customer satisfaction and repeat sales</p>
</li>
<li data-end="1523" data-start="1487">
<p data-end="1523" data-start="1489" style="padding-bottom:0"><strong data-end="1294" data-start="1275">Premium quality</strong>: Same FRE excellence, more of it</p>
</li>
<li data-end="1523" data-start="1487"><strong data-end="1357" data-start="1332">Ideal for bulk buyers</strong>: Perfect for loyalty customers who demand quantity without compromise<strong style="letter-spacing: 0px;"> </strong></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div>
<p data-end="1218" data-start="1071">Whether your customers are stocking up or stepping up their routine, FRE Mega Packs bring more of what they want — <strong data-end="1218" data-start="1186">flavor, strength, and value.</strong></p>
<p data-end="1350" data-start="1220" style="padding-bottom:0">Now available for wholesale order. Don’t miss the chance to stock your shelves with the next big thing in nicotine pouches</p>
Order now through your TPB representative or reply directly to this email to get started.</div>
<div> </div>
<div>
<p data-end="1942" data-start="1801" style="padding-bottom:0">Best,</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
